        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    measurements = [-3, -11, 3, -18, 18, 20, -6, 9, 2, -16]\n    sample_size = len(measurements)\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    mean = sum(measurements) / sample_size\n    sample_variance = sum(\n        (value - mean) ** 2 for value in measurements\n    ) / (sample_size - 1)\n    sample_standard_deviation = sample_variance ** 0.5\n    answer = round(sample_standard_deviation, 3)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
